{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ANALOG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Analog</i> is game series that combines a <strong>first person horror experience</strong> with <strong>analog horror</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/b3d37150b61eae3dd36bb983600358f3.poster.avif?t=1752866056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/b3d37150b61eae3dd36bb983600358f3.webm?t=1752866056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/b3d37150b61eae3dd36bb983600358f3.mp4?t=1752866056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKIN OFF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Skin off</i> is the first game in <i>Analog,</i> where you play as a teenager during summer break. You decide to stay at your uncle's house away from the city with your friends. A strange message, however, appears on the TV that changes your plans. <strong>Follow the instruction</strong> if you want to survive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/939799148b4fcdcd6a0efe3fae17a2e8.poster.avif?t=1752866056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/939799148b4fcdcd6a0efe3fae17a2e8.webm?t=1752866056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/extras/939799148b4fcdcd6a0efe3fae17a2e8.mp4?t=1752866056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its <strong>VHS like visuals</strong>\u00a0and\u00a0<strong>creepy atmosphere\u00a0</strong><i>Skin off</i> fully immerses you to its nostalgic\u00a0<strong>90's aesthetic</strong>, so you can experience analog horror in the appropriate environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Roll Credits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544080/7d9cc25c823cc16213569ae8d72fad829690f590.jpg"},{"name":"Untouchable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544080/7e708c60049c0ecae9623b4bcbe85e07e37f7b8a.jpg"},{"name":"TV Junkie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544080/e2bebb685831a693fa6a5c3e238429deace1ba24.jpg"},{"name":"Mirror Mirror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3544080/eaeaf3e41e5fad9e711d344affbf0061f939442b.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544080?t=1752866056","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3544080?t=1752866056","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/7deea6b8fa1f0d110a51b027fdde935e6df09561/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752866056","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544080/7deea6b8fa1f0d110a51b027fdde935e6df09561/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752866056","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ANALOG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Analog</i> is game series that combines a <strong>first person horror experience</strong> with <strong>analog horror</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"b